#: ../../tools/variant_validator_tools.rst:32 1ceb144da504456ab73046f734302323
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all transcripts for a gene using VariantValidator. "
"Returns MANE Select and MANE Plus Clinical transcript annotations, "
"Ensembl and RefSeq transcript identifiers, genomic coordinates, and "
"cross-references. Useful for identifying the correct transcript for "
"variant annotation. Supports filter for MANE transcripts only or all "
"transcripts."
msgstr ""

